OL,3,GNEWSAMercury Prize events to show off
OL,4,A'phenomenal' scene
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth-east England feels like the
OL,7,Fcentre of the music scene ahead of the
OL,8,FMercury Prize, a musician has said.
OL,10,FThe first event of the Mercury Prize
OL,11,FFringe is to begin later, kickstarting
OL,12,Fa week-long programme of performances,
OL,13,Fworkshops and talks across Tyneside.
OL,15,FIt is the prestigious music award's
OL,16,Fsecond year in Newcastle, with Geordie
OL,17,FSam Fender taking home the prize in
OL,18,F2025 for his album People Watching.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
