OL,3,GNEWSAMercury Prize events to show off
OL,4,A'phenomenal' scene
OL,5,
OL,6,FTom A. Smith, from Sunderland, will
OL,7,Fheadline BBC Introducing Live at the
OL,8,FGlasshouse on Monday and said Fender's
OL,9,Fsuccess had "inspired a generation of
OL,10,Fbands" in the region.
